WEBVTT

00:00:16.195 --> 00:00:19.675
Mike, this might sound crazy,
but I don't think that kid's dangerous.

00:00:20.115 --> 00:00:22.635
Really? Well, in that case,
let's keep it.

00:00:22.715 --> 00:00:24.675
I always wanted a pet
that could kill me!

00:00:24.755 --> 00:00:27.115
What if we just
put her back in her door?

00:00:27.195 --> 00:00:28.795
-What?
-Mike, think about it.

00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:32.555
We send her back,
everything goes back to normal.

00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:34.715
Is that a joke?
Tell me you're joking.

00:00:35.995 --> 00:00:38.115
Sulley, I think that given
the circumstance

00:00:38.195 --> 00:00:40.035
I've been extremely forgiving till now.

00:00:40.115 --> 00:00:41.635
But that is a horrible idea.

00:00:41.675 --> 00:00:44.435
Are we gonna march in public
with that thing?

00:00:44.675 --> 00:00:47.355
Then I guess we waltz
right up to the factory, right?

00:00:48.795 --> 00:00:52.155
I can't believe we are waltzing
right up to the factory.

00:00:52.475 --> 00:00:55.475
Sulley, a mop, a couple of lights
and some chair fabric

00:00:55.515 --> 00:00:58.235
are not gonna fool anyone.
Think about names.

00:00:58.315 --> 00:01:00.595
Loch Ness. Bigfoot.
The Abominable Snowman.

00:01:00.635 --> 00:01:03.395
They all got one thing in common.
Banishment!

00:01:03.475 --> 00:01:06.155
-We could be next.
-Don't panic. We can do this.

00:01:06.195 --> 00:01:08.275
-How you doing, Frank?
-Hey, guys.

00:01:08.315 --> 00:01:10.555
Everything's going to be OK.

00:01:10.635 --> 00:01:11.635
(GASPS)

00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:17.435
CDA AGENT 1: Number one wants this
dusted for prints.

00:01:17.475 --> 00:01:20.155
CDA AGENT 2: Careful with that.
CDA AGENT 3: I got a good view.

00:01:20.555 --> 00:01:21.995
CDA AGENT 4: A little lower.

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:24.315
This was recovered at the scene.

00:01:24.395 --> 00:01:26.315
-Don't panic.
-Don't tell me not to.

00:01:26.395 --> 00:01:28.035
-Keep it together.
-It's not OK.

00:01:28.675 --> 00:01:30.435
-Boo.
-Could be contaminated.

00:01:30.515 --> 00:01:33.075
Gentlemen, safety
is our number-one concern.

00:01:33.195 --> 00:01:35.995
If there's anything that...
Not now. I'm...

00:01:36.195 --> 00:01:37.955
Oh, hello, little one.

00:01:37.995 --> 00:01:40.355
-Where did you come from?
-Mr. Waternoose!

00:01:40.515 --> 00:01:42.515
James, is this one yours?

00:01:42.555 --> 00:01:44.755
Actually, that's my cousin's sister's

00:01:44.835 --> 00:01:46.995
-daughter, sir.
-Yeah, it's...

00:01:47.115 --> 00:01:50.195
Bring an Obscure Relative
to Work Day.

00:01:50.915 --> 00:01:53.515
Must have missed the memo.
Well, listen, James,

00:01:53.595 --> 00:01:55.995
why don't you stop by the simulator
after lunch

00:01:56.035 --> 00:01:58.795
and give us that scare demonstration?

00:01:58.875 --> 00:02:00.635
Yeah. Oh, sir...

00:02:00.715 --> 00:02:03.035
-Mr. Waternoose?
-Yes, yes. I'm coming.

00:02:03.515 --> 00:02:05.555
I'll see you this afternoon, James.

00:02:05.675 --> 00:02:08.755
That is, if these gentlemen
haven't shut us down.

00:02:08.835 --> 00:02:10.595
-Oh, boy.
-A scare demo.

00:02:10.675 --> 00:02:12.515
That is great.
Why am I the last to know?

00:02:12.555 --> 00:02:15.875
We could bring your cousin's sister's
daughter. She'll be a big hit.

00:02:15.915 --> 00:02:16.955
(EQUIPMENT BUZZING LOUDLY)

00:02:17.035 --> 00:02:18.355
Halt.

00:02:19.795 --> 00:02:21.235
Hold him down.

00:02:25.275 --> 00:02:26.755
Come on. The coast is clear.

00:02:27.235 --> 00:02:29.435
OK. All we have to do
is get rid of that thing.

00:02:29.515 --> 00:02:31.395
So wait here while I get its card.

00:02:31.435 --> 00:02:34.075
She can't stay here.
This is the men's room.

00:02:35.235 --> 00:02:37.155
That is the weirdest thing
you've ever said.

00:02:37.915 --> 00:02:40.355
Look. It loves it here.
It's dancing with joy.

00:02:40.395 --> 00:02:41.755
(GRUNTS)

00:02:41.835 --> 00:02:44.035
I'll be right back with its door key.

00:02:46.035 --> 00:02:49.755
That's a cute little dance.
It almost looks like you've got to...

00:02:49.835 --> 00:02:51.435
(WHINING)

00:02:52.155 --> 00:02:53.155
Oh.

00:02:54.475 --> 00:02:56.435
(SINGING IN BABY TALK)

00:03:04.755 --> 00:03:06.435
Are you done in there?

00:03:07.555 --> 00:03:08.595
(SQUEALS)

00:03:08.635 --> 00:03:10.275
Sorry, sorry.

00:03:11.275 --> 00:03:13.115
(SINGING)

00:03:20.395 --> 00:03:21.795
(TOILET FLUSHES)

00:03:23.195 --> 00:03:25.435
OK. You're finished now, right?

00:03:25.915 --> 00:03:27.115
Hello?

00:03:27.755 --> 00:03:28.915
(GASPS)

00:03:30.995 --> 00:03:32.115
Boo.

00:03:34.435 --> 00:03:35.955
(SIGHS IN RELIEF)

00:03:42.755 --> 00:03:44.195
Where did she go?

00:03:45.515 --> 00:03:47.115
Did she disappear?

00:03:47.435 --> 00:03:49.475
Did she turn invisible?

00:03:50.595 --> 00:03:52.915
I just have no idea.

00:03:53.955 --> 00:03:55.275
Gotcha.

00:03:56.395 --> 00:03:57.475
Boo.

00:04:00.275 --> 00:04:01.835
Hey, you're good.

00:04:08.155 --> 00:04:10.675
Be relaxed. Be relaxed. Be relaxed.

00:04:11.235 --> 00:04:14.835
Roz, my tender oozing blossom.
You're looking fabulous today.

00:04:14.915 --> 00:04:18.075
Is that a new haircut?
Tell me, it's a new haircut.

00:04:19.195 --> 00:04:21.595
New makeup. You had a lift.
You had a tuck. You had something.

00:04:21.995 --> 00:04:24.715
Something has been inserted in
your skin that makes you look like...

00:04:27.555 --> 00:04:31.595
I need a favor. Randall was working
late last night on the scare floor.

00:04:31.675 --> 00:04:34.035
I need the key
for the door he was using.

00:04:34.515 --> 00:04:37.355
Well, isn't that nice?

00:04:37.435 --> 00:04:41.355
But guess what? You didn't turn in
your paperwork last night.

00:04:41.435 --> 00:04:43.475
He didn't... No paperwork?

00:04:43.515 --> 00:04:45.395
This office is now closed.

00:04:46.795 --> 00:04:47.995
(MIKE SCREAMING)

00:04:48.715 --> 00:04:51.075
Ready or not, here I come.

00:04:51.155 --> 00:04:52.515
I'm getting warmer.

00:04:52.555 --> 00:04:54.195
Any second now.

00:04:54.275 --> 00:04:58.155
-Fee, fi, fo...
-What are you doing?

00:04:58.875 --> 00:05:00.355
I'm looking for the kid.

00:05:00.395 --> 00:05:03.035
-You lost it?
-No, no. She was just...

00:05:04.635 --> 00:05:05.875
Here she is.

00:05:05.955 --> 00:05:07.595
Hey. What's the matter?

00:05:07.675 --> 00:05:10.835
RANDALL: I already told your buddies...
CDA AGENT: All right. Carry on.

